CodeSystem: Form096SnomedSupplementCS
Id: form096-snomed-supplement-cs
Title: "Form 096 SNOMED CT Displays"
Description: "Uzbek and Russian displays for the SNOMED CT codes used by Form 096 that Form 111 does not already translate"

* insert SupplementCodeSystemDraft(form096-snomed-supplement-cs, $sct, 2026.1.0)

